02:10.228 --> 02:12.085
So this is going to,
this is the same thing

02:12.085 --> 02:16.868
as 17 times three is 51.

02:16.868 --> 02:19.399
51 plus,

02:19.399 --> 02:22.199
six times nine is 54.

02:22.419 --> 02:24.472
So this is 54.

02:24.472 --> 02:25.412
And what is this?

02:25.412 --> 02:28.367
Is this less than or equal to 150?

02:28.367 --> 02:30.524
Is that less than or equal to 150?

02:30.524 --> 02:34.003
Let's see, 51 plus 54 is going to be 105.

02:34.003 --> 02:36.824
So that indeed is less
than or equal to 150.

02:36.824 --> 02:38.104
So that checks out.

02:38.104 --> 02:40.753
So she has more than enough boards.

02:40.753 --> 02:42.678
So she has enough boards.

02:42.678 --> 02:43.905
Let me write that.

02:43.905 --> 02:45.940
Enough boards.

02:45.940 --> 02:48.772
Now let's see if she has enough nails.

02:48.772 --> 02:49.835
Let's see if she has,

02:49.835 --> 02:50.992
that came out weird,

02:50.992 --> 02:52.511
enough boards.

02:52.511 --> 02:54.240
Let's see if she has enough nails.

02:54.240 --> 02:56.230
So three tables are going to require

02:56.230 --> 03:00.110
34 times three nails.

03:00.110 --> 03:02.969
So 34 nails per table times three tables.

03:02.969 --> 03:05.152
So 34 times three.

03:05.152 --> 03:07.620
