03:14.594 --> 03:17.547
27 times nine.

03:17.877 --> 03:18.750
We need to figure out,

03:18.750 --> 03:23.070
is this less than or equal to 330?

03:23.070 --> 03:24.011
And so let's see.

03:24.011 --> 03:28.457
34 times three, that is 100.

03:28.457 --> 03:30.930
No, that's 90 plus 12.

03:30.930 --> 03:32.729
So that's 102

03:32.729 --> 03:36.954
