03:36.954 --> 03:38.313
So let's see, that would be,

03:38.313 --> 03:41.134
was it 243?

03:41.134 --> 03:44.899
Yep, so plus 243.

03:44.899 --> 03:47.226
So it's 102 plus 243,

03:47.226 --> 03:50.733
is that less than or equal to 330?

03:50.733 --> 03:52.379
So let's see, this would be,

03:52.379 --> 03:56.050
this would end up adding up to 345.

03:56.050 --> 04:01.050
No, this is not less than or equal to 330.

04:01.146 --> 04:02.284
This is not the case.

04:02.284 --> 04:03.933
This is not true.

04:03.933 --> 04:06.545
Not true.

04:06.545 --> 04:09.029
So she does not have enough nails.

04:09.029 --> 04:11.722
So not enough,

04:12.152 --> 04:14.692
not enough nails.

04:15.693 --> 04:18.363
And so she has enough
boards but not enough nails.

04:18.363 --> 04:20.196
